    "text": "By Joe Smeltzer ,\n12 days ago For Kirk Herbstreit, Penn State under James Franklin reminds him of another big time program under another Hall of Fame coach. When Herbstreit played quarterback at Ohio State, his coach was a man named John Cooper. Cooper is in the College Football Hall of Fame, having retired with 192 wins,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
